{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464640/extras/ba381c9ade998938870f7a55c951493e.avif?t=1760042553\" width=780 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Forsaken Lands</strong>, you will dive into a world full of thrilling stories. Explore the mysteries of an ancient race hidden within shadowy forests, seek out the Great Necromancer and uncover his secrets. And of course, an epic battle with the Gods in the heavens awaits. To uncover all the secrets of the Forsaken Lands, you'll need to carefully assemble your team of heroes, develop their skills, and strengthen their unity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464640/extras/0b088956bbf2a9204d0bf846ae38152b.poster.avif?t=1760042553\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464640/extras/0b088956bbf2a9204d0bf846ae38152b.webm?t=1760042553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464640/extras/0b088956bbf2a9204d0bf846ae38152b.mp4?t=1760042553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464640/extras/943bac5ec717f2e6e60bcdec72780570.avif?t=1760042553\" width=780 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead a squad of three unique heroes, each with their own deck of cards, special abilities, and distinct playstyle. Combine their strengths and weaknesses to create the perfect team. As you progress, your heroes will grow, gaining new cards, abilities, and customization options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464640/extras/18b55111c820371e9a94f5d073efca4a.avif?t=1760042553\" width=780 height=254 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464640/extras/d4eb3fd6bf3d21ac1349eccd5d47a9bd.avif?t=1760042553\" width=780 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're feeling burned out from theorycrafting heroes, building decks, and chasing optimal routes - the <i>Story Mode</i> is for you!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique narrative campaign for each trio of heroes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover each hero\u2019s backstory, their relationships, and how their fates intertwine across different teams.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore both familiar and entirely new locations, filled with fresh enemies and events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage with memorable characters who, like you, inhabit the world of Forsaken Lands.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464640/extras/3144ba67f09665eda7475e9c24f25025.poster.avif?t=1760042553\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464640/extras/3144ba67f09665eda7475e9c24f25025.webm?t=1760042553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464640/extras/3144ba67f09665eda7475e9c24f25025.mp4?t=1760042553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464640/extras/35894eebbd43e7eae71b063a389d39ab.avif?t=1760042553\" width=780 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not a fan of narrative, or just in the mood for a pure card game experience? Then the special <strong>&quot;Dreams&quot;</strong> mode is for you!<br>In this mode, you'll go through a procedurally generated adventure \u2014 always different, with unique twists not found in the story mode.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle Modifiers</strong> \u2013 Some encounters will have special conditions that change how the battle plays out \u2014 or even your objectives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random events and enemies</strong> you won't see in the story mode.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464640/extras/eec775f236455f6146ad1798b0412899.avif?t=1760042553\" width=780 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form a heroic squad of three players and tackle the &quot;Story&quot; mode or dive into a random &quot;Dream&quot; run together.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run takes around 1\u20131.5 hours \u2014 just like a session-based game night.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hero you play as will progress just like in solo mode - no compromises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the ping system to share information, coordinate tactics... or just annoy your friends!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464640/extras/c70cd838458fd9da7bfceeb50fcfa828.poster.avif?t=1760042553\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464640/extras/c70cd838458fd9da7bfceeb50fcfa828.webm?t=1760042553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464640/extras/c70cd838458fd9da7bfceeb50fcfa828.mp4?t=1760042553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We get it \u2014 you don\u2019t want to buy a pig in a poke. You want to be sure there\u2019s more than just one evening of fun with friends. So to help you make the right choice, here\u2019s what we honestly offer:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 unique heroes at launch, each with their own playstyle, progression, and specialties.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ unique cards per hero.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ neutral cards that any hero can discover during a run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of enemies, minibosses, and full-blown bosses \u2014 some of them will <i>definitely</i> make you sweat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of events that either expand the lore or simply make you smile.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464640/extras/4105ab638631fa4d62cdce6d5be57115.avif?t=1760042553\" width=780 height=90 /></span> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2464640?t=1760042553","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464640/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760042553","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464640/9948b187b64634a4d2f9d35f217235259375597b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760042553","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464640/9948b187b64634a4d2f9d35f217235259375597b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760042553","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464640/extras/ba381c9ade998938870f7a55c951493e.avif?t=1760042553\" width=780 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Forsaken Lands</strong>, you will dive into a world full of thrilling stories. Explore the mysteries of an ancient race hidden within shadowy forests, seek out the Great Necromancer and uncover his secrets. And of course, an epic battle with the Gods in the heavens awaits. To uncover all the secrets of the Forsaken Lands, you'll need to carefully assemble your team of heroes, develop their skills, and strengthen their unity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464640/extras/0b088956bbf2a9204d0bf846ae38152b.poster.avif?t=1760042553\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464640/extras/0b088956bbf2a9204d0bf846ae38152b.webm?t=1760042553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464640/extras/0b088956bbf2a9204d0bf846ae38152b.mp4?t=1760042553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464640/extras/943bac5ec717f2e6e60bcdec72780570.avif?t=1760042553\" width=780 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead a squad of three unique heroes, each with their own deck of cards, special abilities, and distinct playstyle. Combine their strengths and weaknesses to create the perfect team. As you progress, your heroes will grow, gaining new cards, abilities, and customization options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464640/extras/18b55111c820371e9a94f5d073efca4a.avif?t=1760042553\" width=780 height=254 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464640/extras/d4eb3fd6bf3d21ac1349eccd5d47a9bd.avif?t=1760042553\" width=780 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're feeling burned out from theorycrafting heroes, building decks, and chasing optimal routes - the <i>Story Mode</i> is for you!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique narrative campaign for each trio of heroes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover each hero\u2019s backstory, their relationships, and how their fates intertwine across different teams.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore both familiar and entirely new locations, filled with fresh enemies and events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage with memorable characters who, like you, inhabit the world of Forsaken Lands.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464640/extras/3144ba67f09665eda7475e9c24f25025.poster.avif?t=1760042553\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464640/extras/3144ba67f09665eda7475e9c24f25025.webm?t=1760042553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><sou